id: power_manager_core_retention
label: 'Power Manager: Core Retention'
package: platform_core
description: >
  Shared core retention framework for retention-capable power manager
  implementations. Owns the common CPU save/restore machinery.
category: Services|Power Manager
quality: evaluation
metadata:
